OL,3,GNEWSAFirst British Titanic diver to
OL,4,Atell stories from wreck visits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first British diver to visit the
OL,7,FTitanic wreckage will feature in a new
OL,8,Fexhibition in Liverpool, telling
OL,9,Fstories from his explorations of the
OL,10,Fdoomed ocean liner alongside items
OL,11,Fretrieved from the ship.
OL,13,FThe vessel famously sank in the north
OL,14,FAtlantic on 15 April 1912 after hitting
OL,15,Fan iceberg, resulting in the loss of
OL,16,Fsome 1,500 lives.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
