PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1794122766
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFirst British Titanic diver to
OL,4,Atell stories from wreck visits
OL,5,
OL,6,FDik Barton, who went on to make a total
OL,7,Fof 22 dives to the wreck, said it was
OL,8,F"so exciting" to bring the exhibition
OL,9,Fto the former headquarters of the
OL,10,Fship's White Star Line operator, which
OL,11,Fis now a hotel.
OL,13,FIt will feature talks from Barton,
OL,14,Fparts of the kits he used in his dives,
OL,15,Ffragments of the ship people can touch,
OL,16,Fand footage from his visits to the
OL,17,Fwreck, which lies some 3,800m (2.4m)
OL,18,Fdeep on the seabed.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
